    "用 eng-audit 对当前仓库的工程文档做一次一致性审查"
  ],
  "author": {
    "name": "TidaltoLabs",
    "url": "https://github.com/TidaltoLabs"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/TidaltoLabs/eng-system",
